WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.000
<v You>You：…Is this Azuchi Castle?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.336
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Hoh — a guest in strange clothes.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.701
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Where have you come from?

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.000
<v You>You：From 400 years in the future. I brought you some drinks.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.036
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Drink from the future? Splendid — show me!

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.250
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.600
<v You>You：First, Yamazaki — whisky made at Yamazaki, near Kyoto.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.308
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Oh… amber, and clear as glass.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.799
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Yamazaki… the foot of Mount Tennō. Let's see.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.810
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Mm. A sweet scent, right through the nose.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.775
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.636
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：My throat's on fire — and it's delicious! I like it!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.443
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Might I have a glass as well?

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.100
<v You>You：For you, Lord Ieyasu: Hakushu — fresh, made with forest water.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.144
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：What are those bubbles?

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.500
<v You>You：It's a highball — whisky with soda.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:05.509
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：…Oh, so cold. It smells of young leaves.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:11.944
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Excellent. I'd want this on a summer campaign.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:17.417
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Not fair, Ieyasu hogging it. Hand it here.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.750
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha!

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.750
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.800
<v You>You：Last, Hibiki — many whiskies blended into one harmony.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.091
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Harmony, eh. That's how I want the realm to be.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.720
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Truly. Come — let us taste it.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.529
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Like honey.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:41.183
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：…It smells of flowers.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.622
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…and then a warm glow.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.442
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：…and the finish lingers long.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.175
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:51.750
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:54.730
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Magnificent! Future drink — well done!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.600
<v You>You：I'm so glad you like it.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.553
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Do people in the future drink this every night?

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.800
<v You>You：…Well, not every night.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.350
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:09.927
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：The future sounds like a fine age.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:13.037
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：I've got these names by heart.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.059
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Now, everyone — kanpai!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.499
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.850
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:23.701
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：…Do bring us more from the future.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.779
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Next time, I'll be the one treating you.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:30.000
<v You>You：Yes. Until next time.
